https://github.com/sherlock-audit/2023-12-flatmoney/blob/main/flatcoin-v1/src/LimitOrder.sol#L58

## Tool used
Manual Review

## Recommendation
When creates a limit order, protocol should check if the position NFT token is locked and revert if so. 

